## 1. GoldPressedLatinum (GPL Token)

### Core Features
- **OFTv2 Standard**: Cross-chain compatible with LayerZero
- **Supply Cap**: 500,000,000,000 (500B) tokens
- **Decimals**: 18 (standard ERC20)
- **Transfer Lock**: Timestamp-based, owner-adjustable
- **Genesis Bypass**: Genesis wallet can always transfer

### Key Functions

#### For Users
```solidity
// Check balance
function balanceOf(address account) view returns (uint256)

// Transfer tokens (fails during lock)
function transfer(address to, uint256 amount) returns (bool)

// Approve spending
function approve(address spender, uint256 amount) returns (bool)

// Burn your own tokens
function burn(uint256 amount)

// Check if transfers are locked
function isTransfersLocked() view returns (bool)
```

#### For Bridge Operations
```solidity
// Send tokens cross-chain
function send(
    SendParam calldata _sendParam,
    MessagingFee calldata _fee,
    address _refundAddress
) payable returns (MessagingReceipt memory msgReceipt, OFTReceipt memory oftReceipt)

// Quote cross-chain fee
function quoteSend(
    SendParam calldata _sendParam,
    bool _payInLzToken
) view returns (MessagingFee memory)
```

#### For Owner (Multisig)
```solidity
// Set hub address (one-time)
function setHub(address _hub)

// Set/unlock transfer lock
function setLockUntil(uint256 _newLockUntil)

// Permanently disable minting
function finalizeMinting()

// Emergency pause
function pause()
function unpause()

// Set cross-chain peer
function setPeer(uint32 _eid, bytes32 _peer)
```

