## 2. LatinumPressHub (Mint Coordinator)

### Mint Phase Parameters
- **USDC Goal**: 1,000,000 USDC
- **Mint Rate**: 1 USDC = 10 GPL
- **Fee**: 0.25% (goes to FeeVault)
- **Min Mint**: 1 USDC

### Key Functions

#### For Users
```solidity
// Mint GPL with USDC
function mint(uint256 _amountUSDC)

// Check remaining cap
function remainingCap() view returns (uint256)

// Get mint progress
function getMintProgress() view returns (
    uint256 currentUSDC,
    uint256 goalUSDC,
    bool goalReached,
    bool vestingStarted
)
```

#### For Owner
```solidity
// End mint phase, start vesting
function finalizeMint()

// Set addresses (one-time each)
function setGPLToken(address _gplToken)
function setLocker(address _locker)
function setFeeVault(address _feeVault)
function setLPWallet(address _lpWallet)

// Emergency controls
function pause()
function unpause()
```

