## 3. VestingLocker

### Vesting Schedule
- **33% Immediate** (after goal reached)
- **67% Linear** over 180 days (6 months)
- **Vesting starts**: When `finalizeMint()` is called on hub

### Key Functions

#### For Users
```solidity
// Claim vested tokens
function claim()

// Check claimable amount
function getClaimable(address user) view returns (uint256)

// Get full user info
function getUserInfo(address user) view returns (
    uint256 totalLocked,
    uint256 claimed,
    uint256 claimable,
    uint256 vestingStart,
    uint256 vestingEnd,
    bool isVestingActive
)

// Check vesting progress
function vestingProgress() view returns (uint256 percentage)
```

#### For Owner
```solidity
// Start vesting (called by hub)
function startVesting()

// Batch claim for users (gas optimization)
function batchClaim(address[] calldata users)

// Emergency controls
function triggerEmergency()
function disableEmergency()
function pause()
function unpause()
```

