## Error Codes (For Debugging)

| Error | Contract | Meaning |
|-------|----------|---------|
| `ExceedsMaxSupply()` | GPL | Can't mint more than 500B |
| `OnlyHub()` | GPL | Only hub can call this function |
| `HubAlreadySet()` | GPL | Hub can only be set once |
| `TransfersLocked()` | GPL | Transfer lock is active |
| `GoalAlreadyReached()` | Hub | Minting goal already hit |
| `NoTokensToClaim()` | Locker | User has no claimable tokens |
| `VestingNotStarted()` | Locker | Vesting hasn't begun yet |
| `NotApproved()` | FeeVault | Project not approved to receive funds |

